            "review_title": "Review at Rosas",
            "review_text": "Debbie B\nGreater Sydney, Australia9 contributions\n0\nModern Italian done well\nJul 2023 • Couples\nIf you’re looking for a more relaxed evening away from the hustle & bustle of Hanoi, Rosas is the dining experience for you, the family, or even the TEAM. A short drive away from the city.\nAn Italian style food, the pork chops were to die for.\nThe atmosphere is welcoming and the service excellent. DON’T leave Rosas out of your Vietnam visit.\nRead more\nWritten July 9, 2023",
