            "review_title": "Review at Rosas",
            "review_text": "Leannie\nHong Kong, China3214 contributions\n1\nFantastic boozy brunch\nJan 2023 • Friends\nCame here with a large group to have a bottlemless brunch for a friends birthday. The price is steep at 1.3m per person so i certainly had high hopes. \nWhen we were seated a selection of meze boards and breads were placed on the table, the meats, cheese and dips were tasty. You could also order off the small plates menu and wow the anchovies and prawns were yummy.\nThe drinks were free flow and largely the staff kept up with that, i enjoyed the wine and many of the group raved about the espresso martini cocktails\nRead more\nWritten January 8, 2023",
