            "review_title": "Review at Rosas",
            "review_text": "Jeni N\nHuizhou, China14 contributions\n0\nRaving over Rosa's\nJun 2020 • Friends\nAbout a dozen teachers gathered at Rosa's to celebrate the last day of school. The food arrived with stellar presentation and taste. The grilled eggplant, carrots, zucchini, the hummus, bread and thinly sliced pepperoni delighted the taste buds. The pizza was good but not 'fantastic,' though the portions were generous. For VND550 we enjoyed free- flow food and drinks for two hours. The atmosphere was welcoming and the staff were doing their best!\n\nI recommend Rosa's!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 14, 2020",
