            "review_text": "TravelinGypsey\n305 contributions\n0\nCute Atmosphere & Will try it again\nNov 2019 • Solo\nI went in excited to try their pizza as it looks delicious on their website. Unfortunately, they didn’t have what I was looking for as their pizza menu changes daily as the waitress informed me. I did a take away order- which is a to go order in case your new to the lingo here :) the security was extra helpful with parking my bike as it was raining. Atmosphere looks nice and they have a DJ playing music (I went on a Friday) so I will try again for a dine in with some friends. From what I did order I would say an average rating. Prices were great, the Caesar salad was good but they add an egg which isn’t fully hard boiled and it’s runny so if you like that then forsure try this Caesar I just wasn’t a fan of that. Will try this place again though!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 2, 2019",
